\set ECHO none
1..7
ok 1 - Create non-superuser role
ok 2 - Non-superuser DROP SCHEMA CASCADE
ok 3 - Non-superuser DROP OWNED BY
ok 4 - Insert stale registration
ok 5 - Stale registration is present
ok 6 - Superuser DROP SCHEMA with stale registration
ok 7 # SKIP existing mode: extension_drop's placement is outside this suite's control
# TRANSACTION INTENTIONALLY LEFT OPEN!
